#: applications/luci-app-samba4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/samba4.js:68
msgid "Enable macOS compatible shares"
msgstr "Cumasaigh scaireanna comhoiriúnacha macOS"

#: applications/luci-app-samba4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/samba4.js:60
msgid ""
"Enable some community driven tuning parameters, that may improve write "
"speeds and better operation via WiFi."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-samba4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/samba4.js:69
msgid ""
"Enables Apple's AAPL extension globally and adds macOS compatibility options "
"to all shares."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaíonn sé síneadh AAPL Apple ar fud an domhain agus cuireann sé roghanna "
"comhoiriúnachta macOS leis na scaireanna go léir."

#: applications/luci-app-samba4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/samba4.js:125
