msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Comhéadan"

#: applications/luci-app-samba4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/samba4.js:37
msgid "Listen only on the given interface or, if unspecified, on lan"
msgstr ""
"Éist ar an gcomhéadan tugtha amháin nó, mura bhfuil sé sonraithe, ar lan"

#: applications/luci-app-samba4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/samba4.js:105
